= \\frac{a_6}{a_5} = \\frac{35}{30} = \\frac{7}{6}.$$\n\nTo verify and find $r$, we can use a common ratio as among its terms:\n$$r = \\frac{a_5}{a_4} = \\frac{30}{25} = \\frac{6}{5}.$$\n\nHence, the common ratio of the new geometric sequence is $\\boxed{\\frac{6}{5}}$.",
